WEBVTT

00:08.100 --> 00:11.040
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.770 --> 00:14.710
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:15.380 --> 00:18.340
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.880 --> 00:21.710
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.620 --> 00:25.480
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:26.120 --> 00:29.150
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.720 --> 00:32.750
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:33.460 --> 00:35.860
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.860 --> 00:38.870
Don't be afraid

00:38.870 --> 00:40.600
Going from one push after another

00:40.600 --> 00:42.440
The surprising feeling is nice

00:42.440 --> 00:44.070
And you end up dancing till morning

00:44.070 --> 00:45.910
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.910 --> 00:49.310
TROPICANA

00:51.380 --> 00:54.400
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:55.080 --> 00:58.140
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.720 --> 01:01.650
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:02.260 --> 01:05.250
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.990 --> 01:08.830
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:09.600 --> 01:12.390
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:13.030 --> 01:16.060
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.800 --> 01:18.770
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:22.080 --> 01:23.480
Good morning!

01:23.850 --> 01:26.820
Love, Love Grandpa

01:27.290 --> 01:30.150
Oh, Marie, you made a new outfit?

01:33.330 --> 01:34.450
It's cute!

01:34.960 --> 01:37.360
Really? Do you think so too, Haré?

01:37.500 --> 01:40.020
Oh, yeah, I think so. It's cute.

01:41.300 --> 01:42.300
I'm so glad.

01:42.300 --> 01:44.670
It took me quite a while to make this...

01:44.900 --> 01:46.130
You really are good at it.

01:46.440 --> 01:48.500
I can't do anything even close to that.

01:48.570 --> 01:49.840
Then, I'll teach you.

01:50.010 --> 01:51.000
Really?

01:51.340 --> 01:52.110
What do you want me to say?

01:52.110 --> 01:53.210
What should I start with?
What do you want me to say?

01:53.210 --> 01:53.740
What should I start with?

01:53.810 --> 01:54.300
Morning.

01:54.450 --> 01:55.440
Morning...

01:59.590 --> 02:01.490
It's really hot lately.

02:01.590 --> 02:03.180
Y-Yeah...

02:04.990 --> 02:06.620
What's with that hairdo?

02:06.960 --> 02:08.450
It's different from usual.

02:08.530 --> 02:10.390
It's not different, but...

02:10.660 --> 02:12.320
So out of style!

02:13.170 --> 02:16.460
Oh, but in Gupta's mind, that might be the
cool thing...

02:16.700 --> 02:19.070
Really? That doesn't seem likely...

02:19.240 --> 02:20.670
Maybe he's doing it as a gag.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.770
As a gag?

02:23.040 --> 02:25.510
If he's doing it for a laugh, we need to
respond.

02:27.880 --> 02:30.080
You say we need to respond, but...

02:30.150 --> 02:32.450
And, if he thinks that it's cool...

02:36.190 --> 02:37.160
Hey, Gupta.

02:37.290 --> 02:39.090
That's a really interesting hairdo.

02:39.220 --> 02:40.690
Yeah! It's funny! It makes us laugh.

02:40.760 --> 02:41.590
It's the best!

02:42.560 --> 02:45.430
What? I happen to like this hairdo!!

02:51.000 --> 02:53.060
Now, all of you, to your seats.

02:53.470 --> 02:55.370
That's it! Maybe the teacher will notice it and
say something!

02:55.610 --> 02:56.600
That's true.

03:00.380 --> 03:01.310
Now then...

03:04.120 --> 03:05.980
First period is a siesta.

03:09.960 --> 03:12.520
Aren't you putting too much hope in the
wrong person?

03:12.620 --> 03:14.460
Yeah... That's so true.

03:20.070 --> 03:22.470
School is over, and still no one's said
anything.

03:22.630 --> 03:24.630
Why won't anyone say anything?

03:25.100 --> 03:28.500
At times like this, we should set fears aside
and say what needs to be said.

03:28.940 --> 03:31.880
That's what friendship and real kindness is
all about.

03:32.280 --> 03:34.340
Oh, for once, you're saying something
reasonable.

03:34.410 --> 03:36.110
But, what should we say?

03:36.550 --> 03:37.650
"Hey, you with the long hair!"

03:37.650 --> 03:39.580
"What's with that whacked-out hairdo?"

03:39.920 --> 03:41.080
That's probably the best bet.

03:41.350 --> 03:42.720
That's a no-go.

03:43.020 --> 03:45.320
I think we should tell him in a nicer way.

03:45.660 --> 03:46.680
For instance...

03:46.960 --> 03:49.590
"Gupta, isn't your hairdo slightly different
today?"

03:49.660 --> 03:50.390
Like that?

03:50.460 --> 03:51.330
Ah! Yeah, that.

03:51.530 --> 03:53.120
All right, that's good. Go say it.

03:53.270 --> 03:53.790
Yeah.

03:56.070 --> 03:57.300
Wait! Why me?

03:57.300 --> 03:58.860
At a time like this, we should settle who does
it with rock-paper-scissors!

03:59.400 --> 04:01.100
Rock-paper-scissors!

04:02.510 --> 04:03.970
So it's me after all?

04:04.910 --> 04:05.930
Good luck.

04:06.180 --> 04:08.700
Don't worry. We'll collect your bones.

04:09.450 --> 04:10.680
How should I put it?

04:10.750 --> 04:13.580
I can totally see Gupta snapping at me if I put
it the wrong way.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.910
First, I should get Gupta in a good mood...

04:16.490 --> 04:17.460
Hey, Gupta.

04:17.460 --> 04:18.920
Did you see the soccer game last night?

04:18.990 --> 04:20.020
Yeah, I saw it!

04:20.090 --> 04:21.650
It was a really good match!

04:22.390 --> 04:25.090
By the way, isn't your hairdo slightly weird
today?

04:25.530 --> 04:26.160
Hm?

04:26.630 --> 04:27.560
Oh, you're right.

04:27.630 --> 04:28.760
Thanks, Haré!

04:29.600 --> 04:30.590
All right, that's it!

04:31.200 --> 04:31.940
Hey, Gupta.

04:31.940 --> 04:33.500
Did you see the soccer game last night?

04:33.610 --> 04:34.740
Yeah, I saw it!

04:34.740 --> 04:36.230
It was a really good match!

04:37.180 --> 04:39.700
By the way, isn't your hairdo slightly weird
today?

04:39.980 --> 04:42.810
Weird!? What's weird about it?

04:44.680 --> 04:45.670
Gupta, look.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.410
Wah! What is this!?

04:48.690 --> 04:51.020
It's just like it was when I went to sleep last
night!

04:51.120 --> 04:52.110
Huh?

04:52.190 --> 04:52.990
What's that?

04:53.360 --> 04:55.450
You know, it's really hot at night lately.

04:55.590 --> 04:59.090
And since I have long hair, it's hot to sleep
with my hair the way it is...

04:59.500 --> 05:01.020
So that's why you had it up.

05:01.330 --> 05:02.460
Exactly.

05:02.630 --> 05:04.300
Then, you should cut it.

05:04.370 --> 05:05.630
Yeah, why don't you cut it?

05:06.040 --> 05:07.510
All right, let's cut it.

05:07.640 --> 05:08.240
Wait!

05:08.240 --> 05:10.040
What are you planning on cutting with that!?

05:10.510 --> 05:12.340
I think you should cut it, too.

05:12.640 --> 05:13.670
Shut up.

05:13.780 --> 05:16.710
You'd look better with shorter hair. Right?

05:16.880 --> 05:17.850
Yup, yup.

05:17.920 --> 05:19.280
You'd look really awesome, I'm sure!

05:19.350 --> 05:20.720
I might fall in love!

05:22.620 --> 05:26.060
It's not that growing my hair out is a personal
policy...

05:26.960 --> 05:27.690
Huh?

05:27.890 --> 05:28.760
But...

05:28.830 --> 05:29.590
But?

05:30.230 --> 05:32.420
That old hairdresser lady sca...

05:32.930 --> 05:33.590
Eh?

05:33.670 --> 05:34.890
- I'm scared of her.

05:35.030 --> 05:35.760
Eh?

05:36.770 --> 05:38.930
I'm scared of the old lady hairdresser!

05:39.240 --> 05:40.140
Huh?

05:40.370 --> 05:43.770
Oh, that old woman that they call the old
barber lady.

05:44.640 --> 05:46.080
It's true. You could say she's a bit strange.

05:46.180 --> 05:48.150
Yeah, she's pretty good at what she does,
but...

05:48.210 --> 05:49.980
She seems to believe in a lot of things.

05:50.080 --> 05:51.480
Yeah, like psychic powers.

05:51.580 --> 05:52.610
Or seeing ghosts.

05:53.050 --> 05:54.210
She claims she saw one for real.

05:55.290 --> 05:58.520
Shut up! Shush! I hate stories like that!

05:58.790 --> 06:03.590
Despite that, the only salon around here is
her place in the next village over.

06:03.900 --> 06:05.230
You just have to go there.

06:05.300 --> 06:07.930
In any case, I'm not brave enough to get my
hair cut alone.

06:08.100 --> 06:10.590
In other words, you want someone to come
with you.

06:10.870 --> 06:14.240
Hmm... But my hair isn't long enough to
bother me yet.

06:14.470 --> 06:15.100
Me, neither.

06:15.210 --> 06:15.940
Me, neither.

06:17.310 --> 06:20.610
Come to think of it, Guu's hair has grown
quite a bit.

06:20.850 --> 06:21.510
Really?

06:24.280 --> 06:25.870
She's right. Aren't you going to cut it?

06:26.080 --> 06:28.110
If you don't mind, tag along with him.

06:29.450 --> 06:30.580
That's fake!

06:30.690 --> 06:31.850
What are you talking about?

06:32.120 --> 06:34.120
That hairdo is much different from a few
minutes ago!

06:34.230 --> 06:36.560
Eh? It's been like this for a while now.

06:36.760 --> 06:37.890
It was long, it was long.

06:38.460 --> 06:39.430
You're kidding...

06:39.930 --> 06:41.830
All of you are being fooled!

06:41.930 --> 06:43.330
I'm not going to fall for it!

06:44.040 --> 06:46.970
That doesn't matter. Let's hurry up and get
haircuts.

06:48.010 --> 06:51.100
I'm all right as long as I'm not all alone with
that old lady.

06:51.880 --> 06:53.610
Are you talking about me?

06:55.150 --> 06:57.240
She's here! The old barber lady!

06:58.220 --> 06:59.650
Oomph!

06:59.720 --> 07:01.190
Grandma, why are you here?

07:01.420 --> 07:04.290
I had a feeling that someone around here
was calling for me.

07:04.490 --> 07:05.890
Nobody was calling for you!

07:06.460 --> 07:11.090
And I dreamed that my late husband was
wandering around this area.

07:11.730 --> 07:13.790
Grandpa, where are you? Where are you?

07:14.330 --> 07:15.270
Yeah, that...

07:15.270 --> 07:18.000
The old lady always talks about stuff like
that!

07:19.600 --> 07:20.590
Oh my... Oh my...

07:20.710 --> 07:22.800
W-What? What is it?

07:22.910 --> 07:24.170
Oh, my...

07:24.280 --> 07:26.340
What's with that stare?

07:26.410 --> 07:27.500
What are your eyes following?

07:27.650 --> 07:32.170
Since you grew your hair out without a
reason, it's gathered demons.

07:33.990 --> 07:37.390
Wow. Gupta really can't handle scary stories
at all.

07:37.460 --> 07:38.750
That's so unexpected.

07:38.920 --> 07:41.790
He's not trying to be cute despite his age, is
he?

07:41.890 --> 07:43.590
Hey, I heard that!!

07:43.760 --> 07:46.890
Well, since my husband predicted that I'd be
here today...

07:46.970 --> 07:49.200
I'll be your special barber on the go.

07:49.300 --> 07:50.860
I'll cut your hair right here.

07:50.940 --> 07:51.770
Now, sit down.

07:52.040 --> 07:54.300
That's great! Get it done right now.

07:54.510 --> 07:55.970
Eh? But...

07:56.040 --> 07:59.700
That's right. You can't keep growing it
forever.

07:59.910 --> 08:01.400
Y-Yeah...

08:04.050 --> 08:06.610
None of you go home, okay? Don't leave me
all alone!

08:06.920 --> 08:07.980
Yeah, yeah.

08:09.020 --> 08:11.020
Now, we'll cut it into a handsome hairdo!

08:11.020 --> 08:13.180
Still, you sure grew it out a lot.

08:14.360 --> 08:17.160
That makes a perfectly handsome guy go to
waste.

08:18.530 --> 08:22.660
Oh, since I haven't seen you in a while, your
guardian spirit has changed.

08:23.500 --> 08:25.330
Right now, it's your late grandmother.

08:26.400 --> 08:30.600
Please, someone, hold my hand until I'm
done getting my hair cut.

08:30.910 --> 08:32.070
Okay, okay.

08:32.840 --> 08:35.110
Gupta's grandma isn't dead yet.

08:35.380 --> 08:36.610
She's still alive and well.

08:36.750 --> 08:38.720
He's already lost all sense of reason.

08:40.950 --> 08:42.750
Hey now, don't fidget.

08:44.790 --> 08:48.760
Ravenna, your guardian spirit is still your
great-grandmother.

08:48.760 --> 08:50.280
She's full of smiles.

08:50.960 --> 08:53.160
You're welcome. Now, don't move.

08:53.930 --> 08:55.560
Hey, what about me?

08:56.800 --> 08:59.700
Of course. Your father and mother are
watching over you.

08:59.900 --> 09:02.670
The two of them are protecting you closely.

09:06.650 --> 09:09.170
Wadi has the spirit of a laughing ferret.

09:10.520 --> 09:11.820
Uighur has...

09:11.820 --> 09:14.520
Oh my, the spirit of a yellow cherry.

09:14.520 --> 09:16.380
You must be anticipating a romance.

09:16.550 --> 09:17.850
Is that really a spirit?

09:18.120 --> 09:20.320
Toposte has the spirit of a monkey.

09:20.560 --> 09:22.390
What's with this spirit of a monkey?

09:22.660 --> 09:26.190
I mean, in this day and age, who would
believe in guardian spirits?

09:26.330 --> 09:27.460
Haré has...

09:34.770 --> 09:35.810
Sagin has the spirit of an elephant, and Laya
has her grandmother's spirit.

09:35.810 --> 09:37.310
Sagin has the spirit of an elephant, and Laya
has her grandmother's spirit.
Eh? What's with
that reaction she had just now?

09:37.310 --> 09:39.500
Sagin has the spirit of an elephant, and Laya
has her grandmother's spirit.
Why is she skipping me? What's my spirit?

09:39.910 --> 09:40.470
Oh?

09:40.550 --> 09:42.270
I've never seen this girl before.

09:46.180 --> 09:48.050
T-This is...

09:48.790 --> 09:50.760
C-Can it be that she can see through Guu?

09:51.160 --> 09:52.780
The truth about Guu might be...

09:59.430 --> 10:00.760
How strange.

10:01.070 --> 10:03.260
S-Strange? What did you see?

10:03.740 --> 10:05.070
Actually, nothing.

10:05.140 --> 10:05.690
Huh?

10:05.940 --> 10:07.810
I can't see a thing.

10:07.810 --> 10:09.430
I must be having a bad day.

10:11.510 --> 10:12.870
There, all done.

10:13.080 --> 10:14.740
Wow, you've gotten cuter!

10:14.810 --> 10:16.340
Looks good, looks good.

10:16.450 --> 10:18.010
My head sure is lighter...

10:18.320 --> 10:20.510
Hey, Guu is going to
get her hair cut next, right?

10:22.950 --> 10:23.580
Why!?

10:24.320 --> 10:27.520
It was annoying, so...

10:27.590 --> 10:28.730
You cut it yourself?

10:28.730 --> 10:30.160
Right! That's it. That's got to be it, right?

10:31.700 --> 10:34.430
How is it? You want to color it blonde again?

10:34.570 --> 10:36.030
No. It's fine for now.

10:36.100 --> 10:37.690
You want to make it white?

10:37.940 --> 10:38.660
White?

10:40.040 --> 10:41.730
No, I think that's going too far...

10:41.810 --> 10:43.770
Really? White is really nice.

10:43.940 --> 10:47.480
My husband had gray hair that glimmered a
bright white...

10:47.480 --> 10:50.040
...so much that his hair was really beautiful.

10:50.320 --> 10:51.340
Oh...

10:51.520 --> 10:54.920
I don't care if he's a ghost. I just want to see
him again.

10:54.990 --> 10:57.750
Cut it out. When you say it like that, he might
actually show up.

10:58.020 --> 11:01.890
Now, I did tell you that I had a dream about
him wandering around this area.

11:02.690 --> 11:04.720
I'm sure he's around here somewhere...

11:05.630 --> 11:07.070
Grandpa!

11:07.070 --> 11:07.970
Grandpa!
Were you two lovey-dovey?

11:07.970 --> 11:08.300
Were you two lovey-dovey?

11:08.570 --> 11:11.970
Of course! We were the happiest couple in
the village.

11:12.040 --> 11:15.470
Hey now, you guys shouldn't stay on campus
so late after school!

11:22.150 --> 11:25.120
Grandpa!

11:28.490 --> 11:30.420
You've finally shown up!

11:30.420 --> 11:32.580
He's out to kill me!
Grandpa came back to kill me!

11:32.720 --> 11:35.280
What kind of a "happy couple" were they?

11:38.860 --> 11:42.660
He's out to kill me!
Grandpa came back to kill me!

11:42.830 --> 11:44.700
What? I don't understand what's going on.

11:45.040 --> 11:47.600
You seem to resemble the old woman's dead
husband.

11:48.070 --> 11:48.770
Eh?

11:48.840 --> 11:51.430
I won't go down without a fight!

11:51.540 --> 11:53.770
If you're going to take someone with you, let
it be this child!

11:55.580 --> 11:56.440
Y-You know...

11:56.510 --> 11:57.110
Don't come near me!

11:57.180 --> 11:58.770
Don't you come near me!

11:59.050 --> 12:00.950
W-What should I do? I have to do
something...

12:01.090 --> 12:03.080
All right, you want me to stop her?

12:03.290 --> 12:05.020
Don't do that!

12:05.020 --> 12:06.420
What part of that old woman are you going to
stop!?

12:07.960 --> 12:09.830
Now then, take a good look.

12:09.830 --> 12:12.960
He doesn't look like he's out to hurt you,
right, Grandma?

12:13.100 --> 12:15.000
Come on, put on a smile.

12:15.000 --> 12:15.930
Smile!

12:16.030 --> 12:17.090
Oh, yeah...

12:20.970 --> 12:22.300
Are you okay?

12:22.570 --> 12:24.440
Take a close look at my face.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.030
Oh.

12:26.240 --> 12:28.710
See, I'm not your husband, right?

12:29.110 --> 12:30.240
Oh...

12:33.920 --> 12:35.980
This old woman could be dangerous.

12:39.490 --> 12:40.550
Oh my...

12:40.630 --> 12:42.680
See, I'm not a ghost, either.

12:42.760 --> 12:43.700
Oh!

12:43.700 --> 12:44.990
Grandpa...

12:45.060 --> 12:47.500
Eh? I'm telling you, I'm not him!

12:47.700 --> 12:51.440
Grandpa, you came all the way out here to
see me. I'm so sorry.

12:51.440 --> 12:52.800
I got too excited.

12:52.900 --> 12:54.460
She's not listening to what anybody's saying.

12:55.210 --> 12:57.570
Do I really look like that husband of hers?

12:57.640 --> 12:58.540
Dunno.

13:00.650 --> 13:03.940
Grandpa, you haven't changed a bit from that
day.

13:07.120 --> 13:09.450
I'm completely different!

13:09.590 --> 13:10.610
Grandpa?

13:10.720 --> 13:12.160
I'm telling you, I'm not Grandpa!

13:12.160 --> 13:13.320
Listen to what people have to say!

13:15.260 --> 13:16.850
What part of him looks similar?

13:17.260 --> 13:18.700
Totally...

13:19.300 --> 13:20.030
...identical!

13:21.030 --> 13:22.290
Actually, isn't he the same guy?

13:22.400 --> 13:23.890
What!? You guys!

13:25.540 --> 13:26.870
Grandpa!

13:26.870 --> 13:28.100
Stop it!

13:28.170 --> 13:29.210
Oh, don't be so shy!

13:29.210 --> 13:30.410
Stop it! Get away from me!

13:30.410 --> 13:31.470
Grandpa!

13:35.650 --> 13:37.140
Have a happy life!

13:37.920 --> 13:39.380
You guys, you'll pay for this!

13:39.480 --> 13:41.290
Grandpa!

13:41.290 --> 13:42.620
Don't follow me!

13:43.290 --> 13:45.480
Grandpa!

13:49.160 --> 13:50.960
Wait, Grandpa!

13:52.530 --> 13:53.690
Grandpa!

13:58.770 --> 13:59.860
Wait!

14:04.140 --> 14:05.470
Grandpa!

14:12.120 --> 14:13.810
Grandpa!

14:26.760 --> 14:28.660
Wow! He's flying!

14:41.580 --> 14:43.170
That look on his face...

14:46.080 --> 14:47.680
Grandpa!

14:48.850 --> 14:50.620
I wonder how far he ran.

14:51.620 --> 14:52.520
Serves him right?

14:53.860 --> 14:54.980
You feel refreshed?

14:55.230 --> 14:57.090
Eh? Yeah.

14:57.530 --> 15:02.860
Could it be that because the doctor is always
giving me a hard time she got back at him for
me?

15:04.170 --> 15:07.240
Guu did this for me, which usually doesn't
happen, yet...

15:07.240 --> 15:10.170
Why are you in our house!?

15:10.270 --> 15:11.100
Go home!!

15:11.210 --> 15:14.740
That old woman is waiting in front of my
room...

15:15.080 --> 15:16.770
Doctor, you really are popular with women.

15:18.420 --> 15:20.410
All jokes aside, can I stay the night here?

15:20.650 --> 15:21.140
Wha...

15:21.290 --> 15:22.150
Sure!

15:22.220 --> 15:22.910
Eh!?

15:23.860 --> 15:27.850
Geez! He was being pestered by the old
woman, and I finally felt that he got what he
deserved!

15:28.230 --> 15:29.520
Guu, doesn't this make you mad?

15:30.360 --> 15:33.160
I figured this would happen from the very
beginning.

15:33.870 --> 15:34.870
It seems a bit too difficult.

15:34.870 --> 15:36.230
It seems a bit too difficult.
So it was just a roundabout way of giving me
a hard time?

15:36.230 --> 15:38.360
Here's the next hint. Look carefully!
So it was just a roundabout way of giving me
a hard time?

15:58.790 --> 16:01.020
Hi Marie-chan, where are you going?

16:01.230 --> 16:03.130
I'm going to visit my sick grandmother.

16:03.530 --> 16:05.390
Where is your grandmother's house?

16:05.600 --> 16:06.760
Deep in the forest.

16:07.370 --> 16:10.230
Upon hearing that, the wolf grinned.

16:11.270 --> 16:15.800
He suggested to Marie that she pick flowers
in the beautiful field.

16:17.610 --> 16:20.130
While she was doing that, he headed over to
Grandmother's house ahead of her.

16:20.780 --> 16:23.510
"Grandma, it's Marie. I'm here to visit you,"

16:24.050 --> 16:27.250
...the wolf said as he impersonated Marie,
and went inside the house.

16:28.890 --> 16:31.010
The grandma seemed to be still asleep.

16:31.690 --> 16:34.660
So the wolf snuck over to the bed, giddy with
excitement...

16:35.330 --> 16:39.590
...and ate up the grandmother with a flick of
the tongue.

16:40.800 --> 16:42.890
Good morning, how are you doing,
Grandmother?

17:01.550 --> 17:02.710
Realistic dream?

17:09.890 --> 17:11.890
Cut it out already.

17:12.560 --> 17:14.160
How long are you going to stay here?

17:14.370 --> 17:17.200
I can't... I can't sleep alone at night
anymore...

17:17.300 --> 17:19.630
Oh, you're such a big baby.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.570
Seems like he was really traumatized.

17:21.810 --> 17:23.010
Oh, Gupta.

17:23.010 --> 17:24.980
D-Damn you, how dare you do that to me
yesterday!

17:26.180 --> 17:29.870
I thought I'd give you some info about that
old barber lady...

17:30.010 --> 17:31.740
Eh? Is she nearby?

17:31.920 --> 17:32.910
You want to know?

17:33.950 --> 17:37.890
I'll think about telling you if you ask me really
nicely.

17:38.920 --> 17:40.290
Ah, it's the old barber lady.

17:41.430 --> 17:44.790
No way! The old woman went back to her
own village last night!

17:45.160 --> 17:47.060
Eh? You're sure about that?

17:47.060 --> 17:49.290
Yeah, I saw it with my own eyes.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.830
How long are you going to hold onto me?

18:17.630 --> 18:19.490
I guess it's all right now.

18:29.870 --> 18:32.780
C-Calm down... Calm down...

18:32.780 --> 18:34.400
There's nothing there...

18:34.880 --> 18:37.580
Everything looks scary because I'm feeling
scared...

18:43.220 --> 18:45.490
W-What? A blackout?

19:12.880 --> 19:14.440
W-Who is it?

19:15.420 --> 19:16.080
Guu.

19:16.890 --> 19:17.820
Guu?

19:18.890 --> 19:20.550
Oh, that girl...

19:21.690 --> 19:22.660
What do you want?

19:23.190 --> 19:24.420
It's nothing important.

19:24.500 --> 19:26.460
If it's nothing important, then don't bother
me.

19:27.330 --> 19:28.390
Don't scare me like that...

19:28.970 --> 19:30.000
Okay.

19:30.000 --> 19:32.700
It was about the old barber lady, but I guess
it doesn't matter.

19:32.870 --> 19:33.570
Oh!

19:33.570 --> 19:35.600
Wait, I'll open the door right away.

19:37.010 --> 19:38.170
W-What?

19:42.710 --> 19:43.940
You damn...!

19:44.050 --> 19:44.880
What's wrong?

19:45.420 --> 19:47.110
Oh, nothing.

19:53.790 --> 19:56.280
So, what was that about the old woman?

19:56.790 --> 19:59.790
I did some snooping for you.

20:00.160 --> 20:02.460
The old woman went home...

20:02.570 --> 20:03.970
I know that.

20:04.070 --> 20:06.330
Then withdrew her life savings from the bank
and went to an esthetician.

20:06.570 --> 20:07.560
Esthetician?

20:07.670 --> 20:11.630
She had all her excess hair removed and her
nose hair pulled. And she bought a new
shade of lipstick.

20:11.710 --> 20:12.900
Hey, hey...

20:13.010 --> 20:18.240
Then she ordered a custom made new outfit
and bought a 3 megapixel digital camera.

20:18.420 --> 20:19.580
Hold on!

20:19.580 --> 20:21.780
Geez, what kind of an old woman is this!?

20:22.290 --> 20:25.650
The fact that the old lady went to an
esthetician has nothing to do with me!

20:26.090 --> 20:26.990
Nothing to do with you, eh?

20:27.160 --> 20:29.650
The bigger question is where she is right
now.

20:30.290 --> 20:31.120
That would be...

20:31.200 --> 20:31.750
Huh?

20:32.160 --> 20:32.860
Right here.

20:41.670 --> 20:43.160
Grandpa!

20:43.310 --> 20:48.770
In addition to the digital camera, I bought a
nightscope that gives me great vision in the
dark.

20:50.380 --> 20:53.040
Now, I can follow you wherever you go!

20:53.150 --> 20:58.990
I'm informing you now that the old barber
lady has come back as a full-fledged stalker.

20:59.290 --> 21:00.760
Grandpa!

21:01.490 --> 21:04.090
Grandpa!

21:04.630 --> 21:07.030
Wait, Grandpa!

21:09.500 --> 21:10.400
Grandpa!

21:10.470 --> 21:11.260
Stop it!

21:11.340 --> 21:14.130
Wait! Wait! Grandpa!

21:14.670 --> 21:16.110
Oh! Why are you touching me there!?

21:17.270 --> 21:19.210
Stop! Please!

21:20.240 --> 21:23.980
Grandpa!

22:35.110 --> 22:35.580
NEXT EPISODE

22:35.580 --> 22:37.440
Hot... So hot...

22:37.440 --> 22:38.650
What's with this heat!?

22:38.650 --> 22:40.750
Even though this is the jungle, this is just way to hot!

22:40.750 --> 22:43.880
Yeah, really! This is just too hot!

22:43.880 --> 22:45.890
Oh, I can't take it anymore!

22:45.890 --> 22:48.320
I can't keep wearing clothes in this heat!

22:48.320 --> 22:51.150
That's right! This is the jungle, so everyone
should live naked!

22:51.220 --> 22:52.230
Okay! I'm taking this off!

22:52.230 --> 22:53.590
Eh? I can't? Why?

22:53.590 --> 22:55.530
We should go to the beach instead of doing
all this here?

22:55.530 --> 22:57.200
Hmm... The beach. Good idea.

22:57.200 --> 22:59.190
All right, everyone! Let's go have a picnic at
the beach!

22:59.370 --> 22:59.670
Next episode of Haré+Guu: In Short, Sea-Pic

22:59.670 --> 23:02.500
Next episode of Haré+Guu: In Short, Sea-Pic

23:02.500 --> 23:03.400
I'll be the main character!

23:03.400 --> 23:04.340
No, that's me!
